@@ -0,0 +1,8 @@
+# Live compatibility research
+
+- Title: VCF 5.0.x is not a supported upgrade path if you are running VCF 4.5.2 version | Publisher: Broadcom Knowledge Base | URL: https://knowledge.broadcom.com/external/article/313502/vcf-50x-is-not-a-supported-upgrade-path.html | Consulted: 2026-08-14 | Conclusion: A 4.5.2 estate must not use 5.0.x as the next lifecycle hop, and current manifest metadata is a technical gate.
+- Title: VMware Cloud Foundation - Upgrade Bundle Details | Publisher: Broadcom Knowledge Base | URL: https://knowledge.broadcom.com/external/article/327207/vmware-cloud-foundation-upgrade-bundle.html | Consulted: 2026-08-14 | Conclusion: The 5.2.1 BOM targets are SDDC Manager 5.2.1.0-24307856, NSX 4.2.1.0.0-24304122, vCenter 8.0.3.00300-24305161, and ESXi 8.0.3-24280767.
+- Title: vRealize Suite / Aria Suite Install and Upgrade Paths on VMware Cloud Foundation 4.4 and above | Publisher: Broadcom Knowledge Base | URL: https://knowledge.broadcom.com/external/article/314665/vrealize-suite-aria-suite-install-and-u.html | Consulted: 2026-08-14 | Conclusion: VCF 4.5.2 and 5.2.1 support Aria Suite Lifecycle 8.18; an 8.10 deployment uses PSPAK 16 to expose 8.12 and an 8.12 deployment uses PSPAK 11 to expose 8.18.
+- Title: Upgrading Aria Operations 8.x to newer version failed with error “Failed The PAK action” | Publisher: Broadcom Knowledge Base | URL: https://knowledge.broadcom.com/external/article/382152/upgrading-aria-operations-8x-to-newer-ve.html | Consulted: 2026-08-14 | Conclusion: Aria Operations 8.10.2 cannot upgrade directly to 8.18.1 and must first reach 8.17.2.
+- Title: VCF upgrade fails with “Retrieving update patches bundles failed” | Publisher: Broadcom Knowledge Base | URL: https://knowledge.broadcom.com/external/article/403047/vcf-upgrade-fails-with-retrieving-update.html | Consulted: 2026-08-14 | Conclusion: The 4.4 or 4.5 to 5.2.1 upgrade requires all necessary 5.2.1 bundles to be present before it can proceed.
+- Title: Upgrade VMware Cloud Foundation (VCF) 4.x and 5.x | Publisher: Broadcom Knowledge Base | URL: https://knowledge.broadcom.com/external/article/405275/upgrade-vmware-cloud-foundation-vcf-4x-a.html | Consulted: 2026-08-14 | Conclusion: Run target prerequisite, hardware, and precheck gates; take restorable SDDC Manager, vCenter, and NSX backups; then upgrade SDDC Manager before domain components.
